    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2035/tlg003/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2035.tlg003.1.1.2.s1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": ">Τὸν δεσπότην θεὸν δηλαδὴ καὶ σωτῆρα Χριστὸν ἀκριβῶς ἄπαν- >τες ἴστε, ἀγαπητοὶ ἀδελφοί, πατέρα τε καὶ υἱὸν εἶναι.",
    "chunk_index": 2,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2035/tlg003/1st1K-grc1#tlg2035.tlg003.1.1.2.s2",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2035/tlg003/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2035.tlg003.1.1.2.s2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": ">φημὶ ἄναρχον ἄνευ τέλους γονέα τοῦ αἰῶνος αὐτοῦ, υἱὸν δέ, τοῦτ᾿ >τὴν τοῦ πατρὸς βούλησιν,",
    "chunk_index": 3,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2035/tlg003/1st1K-grc1#tlg2035.tlg003.1.1.2.s3",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2035/tlg003/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2035.tlg003.1.1.2.s3",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ἥτις οὔτε δέ ἐνθυμήσεώς τινος οὔτε πρὸς τὴν τῶν ἔργων αὐτοῦ τελεσιουργίαν διά τινος ἐξεζητη- >μένης οὐσίας κατελήφθη.",
    "chunk_index": 4,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2035/tlg003/1st1K-grc1#tlg2035.tlg003.1.1.2.s4",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2035/tlg003/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2035.tlg003.1.1.2.s4",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ὃς γὰρ τοῦτο καὶ νοεῖ καὶ νοήσει, >ἕξει πρὸς ἅπαν τιμωρίας γένος ἀκάματον ὑπομονήν.",
    "chunk_index": 5,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2035/tlg003/1st1K-grc1#tlg2035.tlg003.1.2.s1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2035/tlg003/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2035.tlg003.1.2.s1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ἀλλὰ γὰρ ὁ >τοῦ θεοῦ υἱὸς Χριστὸς ὁ τῶν ἁπάντων δημιοεργὸς καὶ τῆς ἀθανα- >σίας αὐτῆς χορηγὸς ἐγεννήθη ὅσον πρὸς πίστιν ἀνῆκεν ᾑ >καμεν, ἐγεννήθη —",
    "chunk_index": 6,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2035/tlg003/1st1K-grc1#tlg2035.tlg003.1.2.s2",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2035/tlg003/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2035.tlg003.1.2.s2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "μᾶλλον δὲ προῆλθεν αὐτὸς καὶ πάντοτε ἐν >πατρὶ ὢν ἐπὶ τὴν τῶν ὑπ’ αὐτοῦ γεγενημένων διακόσμησιν — >τοίνυν ἀμερίστῳ προελεύσει·",
    "chunk_index": 7,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2035/tlg003/1st1K-grc1#tlg2035.tlg003.1.2.s3",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2035/tlg003/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2035.tlg003.1.2.s3",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ἡ γὰρ βούλησις ὁμοῦ καὶ τῷ >αὐτῆς ἐμπέπηγε καὶ ταῦθ’ ἅπερ διαφόρου δέεται ἐπιμελείας κατὰ τὴν >ἑκάστου ποιότητα πράττει τε καὶ διοικεῖ. τί οὐν;",
    "chunk_index": 8,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2035/tlg003/1st1K-grc1#tlg2035.tlg003.1.3.s1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2035/tlg003/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2035.tlg003.1.3.s1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ἔστι τι μεταξὺ >τοῦ θεοῦ τοῦ πατρὸς καὶ τοῦ υἱοῦ; οὐδὲν δηλαδή·",
    "chunk_index": 9,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2035/tlg003/1st1K-grc1#tlg2035.tlg003.1.3.s2",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2035/tlg003/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2035.tlg003.1.3.s2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "αὕτη γὰρ ἡ τῶν πραγμάτων συμπλήρωσις αἰσθήσει παρείληφε τὸ τῆς βουλήσεως πρόσ- >ταγμα, οὐχὶ δὲ μερισθεῖσαν ἐκ τῆς τοῦ πατρὸς οὐσίας τὴν >διέστησεν.",
    "chunk_index": 10,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2035/tlg003/1st1K-grc1#tlg2035.tlg003.1.3.s3",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2035/tlg003/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2035.tlg003.1.3.s3",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ὅ δὲ τούτοις ἕπεται· τίς έστιν, ὃς τοῦ Χριστοῦ τοῦ ἐμοῦ >δεσπότου ὀπαδὸς δι’ αἰδῶ μᾶλλον ἢ μωρίαν δέδιεν;",
    "chunk_index": 11,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2035/tlg003/1st1K-grc1#tlg2035.tlg003.1.4",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2035/tlg003/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2035.tlg003.1.4",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ἀρ’ οὖν πάσχει",
    "chunk_index": 12,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2035/tlg003/1st1K-grc1#tlg2035.tlg003.1.4.1.s1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2035/tlg003/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2035.tlg003.1.4.1.s1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": ">τὸ θεῖον, ἐπειδὰν ἡ τοῦ σεμνοῦ σώματος οἴκησις πρὸς >τῆς ἰδίας ἁγιότητος ὁρμᾷ, ἢ ὑποπίπτει θίξει τὸ τοῦ σώματος >χωρισμένον;",
    "chunk_index": 13,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2035/tlg003/1st1K-grc1#tlg2035.tlg003.1.4.1.s2",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2035/tlg003/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2035.tlg003.1.4.1.s2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ἆρ’ οὐχὶ διέστηκε τοῦθ’ ὅπερ ἐκ τῆς τοῦ σώματος >ρηται ταπεινότητος; οὐχὶ δὲ ζῶμεν, κἂν πρὸς θάνατον ἡ τῆς >εὔκλεια τὸ σῶμα προσκαλέσηται;",
    "chunk_index": 14,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2035/tlg003/1st1K-grc1#tlg2035.tlg003.1.5.s1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2035/tlg003/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2035.tlg003.1.5.s1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": ">Τί τοίνυν ἐνταῦθα ἡ ἀβλαβής τε καὶ εἰλικρινὴς πίστις ἄξιον >ἀμφιβολίας κατείληφεν;",
    "chunk_index": 15,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2035/tlg003/1st1K-grc1#tlg2035.tlg003.1.5.s2",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2035/tlg003/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2035.tlg003.1.5.s2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ἢ οὐχ ὁρᾷς ὅτι σεμνότατον σῶμα ὁ >ἐπελέξατο, δι’ οὗ τὰ τῆς πίστεως τεκμήρια καὶ τὰ τῆς οἰκείας >τῆς ὑποδείγματα ἔμελλεν ἐμφανίζειν,",
    "chunk_index": 16,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2035/tlg003/1st1K-grc1#tlg2035.tlg003.1.5.s3",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2035/tlg003/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2035.tlg003.1.5.s3",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "καὶ τὴν ἤδη >ὀλεθρίῳ πλάνῃ τοῦ ἀνθρωπίνου γένους ἀπώλειαν ἀποσείεσθαι.",
    "chunk_index": 17,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2035/tlg003/1st1K-grc1#tlg2035.tlg003.1.5.s4",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2035/tlg003/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2035.tlg003.1.5.s4",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": ">τε θρησκείας διδόναι διδασκαλίαν καὶ τῷ τῆς ἁγνείας ὑποδείγματι >τὰς ἀναξίας τοῦ νοῦ πράξεις καθαίρειν, ἔπειτα δὲ τὴν μὲν τοῦ >θανάτου βάσανον ἐκλύειν, τὰ δὲ τῆς ἀθανασίας ἔπαθλα προαναφω- >νεῖν.",
    "chunk_index": 18,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2035/tlg003/1st1K-grc1#tlg2035.tlg003.1.6.s1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2035/tlg003/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2035.tlg003.1.6.s1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ἀλλ’ ὑμεῖς, οὓς λοιπὸν ἀδελφοὺς ἡ τῆς ἀγάπης κοινωνία >εἰκότως ὑπ’ ἐμοῦ προσαγορεύεσθαι ποιεῖ, οὐκ ἀγνοεῖτέ με τὸν >τερον συνθεράποντα,",
    "chunk_index": 19,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2035/tlg003/1st1K-grc1#tlg2035.tlg003.1.6.s2",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2035/tlg003/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2035.tlg003.1.6.s2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "οὐκ ἀγνοεῖτε τὸ τῆς ὑμετέρας σωτηρίας >ρωμα, οὗ τὴν φροντίδα γνησίως ἐπανῄρημαι, καὶ δι’ οὑ τῶν >ἐχθρῶν οὐ μόνον τὰ ὅπλα κατεμαχεσάμεθα ἀλλὰ καὶ ζῶντας ἔτι",
    "chunk_index": 20,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2035/tlg003/1st1K-grc1#tlg2035.tlg003.1.6.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2035/tlg003/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2035.tlg003.1.6.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": ">τὴν ψυχὴν συγκατείρξαμεν πρὸς τὸ τὴν τῆς φιλανθρωπίας >πίστιν ἐκφάναι.",
    "chunk_index": 21,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2035/tlg003/1st1K-grc1#tlg2035.tlg003.1.7.s1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2035/tlg003/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2035.tlg003.1.7.s1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ἀλλ’ ἐγὼ ἐπὶ τοῖς ἀγαθοῖς τούτοις διὰ τὴν τῆς >οἰκουμένης μάλιστα ἀνανέωσιν ἔχαιρον.",
    "chunk_index": 22,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2035/tlg003/1st1K-grc1#tlg2035.tlg003.1.7.s2",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2035/tlg003/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2035.tlg003.1.7.s2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "καὶ γὰρ θαύματος ᾐν >ἀληθῶς ἔθνη τοσαῦτα εἰς ὁμόνοιαν ἐπαγαγεῖν, ἃ πρὸ βραχέος ἐλέγετο >τὸν θεὸν ἀγνοεῖν.",
    "chunk_index": 23,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2035/tlg003/1st1K-grc1#tlg2035.tlg003.1.7.s3",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2035/tlg003/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2035.tlg003.1.7.s3",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "πλὴν τί ἔμελλε γινώσκειν τὰ ἔθνη ταῦτα, ἃ >οὐδεμίαν φιλονεικίας ἐπανῄρηντο φροντίδα;",
    "chunk_index": 24,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2035/tlg003/1st1K-grc1#tlg2035.tlg003.1.7.s4",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2035/tlg003/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2035.tlg003.1.7.s4",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "τί οὐν νοεῖτε, >ἀγαπητοί, ὡς ὑμᾶς αὐτοὺς αἰτιῶμαι; Χριστιανοί ἐσμεν καὶ >διαθέσει διχονοοῦμεν.",
    "chunk_index": 25,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
